title: help:back
tags: [[GUI command]]
kind: reference
summary: Help: back to the page shown before

`help:back` — <<key "help:back" Backspace>> in the [[help panel]]: shows the page shown before this one, as a browser's Back does. Only pages are remembered: back from a search is the page it was typed over. On the first page shown it does nothing. [[help:forward]] walks the other way.
